data: {"type": "thought", "agent_id": "designer-3", "text": "Drafted 'rb780_sas_aom_doublepass_generous' on a 600x350 mm plate: 5x mirror, 3x pbs, 3x beam dump, 2x half wave plate, 2x sampler, 2x photodiode, 1x isolator, 1x vapor cell, 1x aom, 1x lens, 1x quarter wave plate, 1x fiber coupler. 780 nm Rb D2 laser table with generous spacing across a 600 x 350 mm baseplate. An ECDL followed by a Faraday isolator feeds a HWP + PBS that splits ~10% of the light"}

