 2", "group": "aom_dp", "part_number": "BB05-E03", "beam": "L1.t.+1.+1.r.t", "distance_mm": 100.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": 90.0, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": null, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": null, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}, {"id": "FC1", "type": "fiber_coupler", "label": "Output FiberPort (+160 MHz", "group": "aom_dp", "part_number": "PAF2-A4B", "beam": "L1.t.+1.+1.r.t", "distance_mm": 45.0, "at": null, "angle_deg": null, "out_direction_deg": null, "aperture_mm": null, "focal_length_mm": 4.6, "fast_axis_deg": null, "split_ratio": null, "cutoff_nm": null, "reflect": null, "aom_frequency_mhz": null, "aom_efficiency": null, "aom_order": null, "acoustic_velocity_m_s": null, "fiber_mfd_um": 5.3, "transmission": null, "saturation_power_mw": null, "small_signal_gain_db": null, "nl_efficiency_per_w": null}], "targets": [{"element_id": "FC1", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 12.0}, {"element_id": "FC1", "kind": "min_coupling", "value": 0.75}, {"element_id": "FC1", "kind": "polarization", "value": "V"}, {"element_id": "PD_MON", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 0.5}, {"element_id": "PD_SAS", "kind": "min_power_mw", "value": 0.1}], "notes": "Generous spacing on a 600x350 mm baseplate. HWP1 at 9.2 deg reflects ~10% of the isolated 35 mW beam up into the Rb SAS module and transmits ~90% into the f=100 mm cat-eye AOM double-pass (+160 MHz total shift). Double-passed QWP rotates H to V so PBS1 reflects the return beam downward (-y). M_OUT1 and M_OUT2 walk the beam into fiber coupler FC1 after a 5% sampler S_MON sends ~0.95 mW to PD_MON.", "logic": null}, "trace": {"segments": [{"id": "s0", "branch": "L1", "source_id": "L1", "start": [40.0, 130.0], "end": [105.0, 130.0], "direction_deg": 0.0, "l